WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The week in Eplyx. September 21–27, 2026.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
35 commits. Historical replay, upgrade governance, token migration and lifecycle.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Legacy and native v0 replay share pinned state, code and runtime.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Five-transaction causal checkpoint replay keeps derived boundaries explicit.

5
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Bounded Orca SwapV2 and Drift settlePnl adapters measure economic outcomes.

6
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Shared semantic evaluation and onboarding contracts keep coverage explicit. Phoenix replay remains unqualified.

7
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
ChangeSpec binds a proposed upgrade to the exact candidate bytes.

8
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Durable hosted runs separate execution, economic coverage and unexplained changes.

9
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Squads V4 connects the analysis to the proposal. Three real mainnet proposals matched at observed slots.

10
00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Deployment attestation checks execution and deployed bytes. The saved proposal is not executed yet.

11
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.000
Token migration and lifecycle: run locally, inspect results, continue in a workspace.

12
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.000
A real CLI reference-fixture run: mechanism ready, population evidence incomplete.

13
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:18.000
The dashboard connects proposal, population, rehearsal, stress, search, invariants, gate and evidence.

14
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.000
The deadline-defect fixture exposes an unexpected result: 19 of 20 stress cases behaved as specified.

15
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:28.000
Bounded search, state-drift checks and authority checks preserve evidence limits.

16
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:33.000
A saved counterexample can be reproduced offline without replacing its history.

17
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:38.000
Compare runs without treating an absent finding as a proven fix. Export unsigned plans.

18
00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:43.000
Lifecycle analysis separates declared policy and deadlines from observed state and readiness.

19
00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Transfer, bounded Meteora market exit and PositionV2 principal withdrawal keep separate proof.

20
00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:51.000
In the real hosted browser flow, enter a token and wallet. This demonstration uses a synthetic provider.

21
00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:54.000
Inspect the current observation and its focused paths.

22
00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:57.000
Run an exact candidate check and preserve the result.

23
00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Evaluate a lifecycle scenario with separate assurance results.

24
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.000
CLI: analyse, search, gate and export an unsigned plan.

25
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:07.000
Local dashboard: browse runs, inspect stress and reproduce witnesses.

26
00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:11.000
Hosted workspace: device-code login, project access and exact-byte sync.

27
00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:14.000
Current-state browser: observe, check a path and evaluate a declared scenario.

28
00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:20.000
Eplyx. Know what changes before you deploy.
